  "id": "training-evaluation",
  "term": "training evaluation",
  "definition": "Training evaluation is the process of assessing what a training program achieved after it is delivered, including participants’ reactions, what they learned, changes in behavior, and resulting outcomes. In this context, it is used to judge training effectiveness and identify how different aspects of learning and performance relate to one another.",
